---
/* FAQs. */
---

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">FAQs</span>
        <h2>Questions? Look here.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="faq-ask reveal">
        <h3>Can't find your answer?</h3>
        <p>We are almost always active on WhatsApp. Send a message with what you are looking for and we will come back to you straight away — photos, prices and timelines included.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--amber" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I have a question about your furniture.">Ask a question</a>
      </div>
      <div class="faq reveal" data-delay="1">
        <details open>
          <summary>How do I place an order?</summary>
          <p>Message us on WhatsApp at 0907 984 9626 with the piece you want, or send a DM on Instagram (@thatfurnituregirl__) or TikTok (@thatfurnituregirl_). Tell us your colour and size preference and we'll confirm availability, price and delivery.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How long does production take?</summary>
          <p>Most pieces take 5–10 working days. Wardrobes are usually about 5 days, centre tables about 10 days, and some pieces are available for immediate pickup from the showroom. Large bespoke commissions like the Royal Kinging Set take about 3 months.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I change the colour, size or design?</summary>
          <p>Yes — that is what we do. Every piece can be made in the colour of your choice, resized to fit your room, or redesigned. Send us a photo of what you have in mind.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you deliver, and how much does it cost?</summary>
          <p>We offer same-day delivery in Ibadan and our delivery is quick. Delivery to other states nationwide can be arranged — the cost depends on where you are, so message us for a quote.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I see the furniture in person first?</summary>
          <p>Of course. Our showroom is at Iyaganku, New GRA, Ibadan, and walk-ins are welcome. Message us a little ahead of your visit and we'll have the pieces you're interested in ready for you.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you make pieces that aren't on the website?</summary>
          <p>We build beds, dining sets, office furniture, TV stands and complete house packages. If you can picture it, send us a photo or a sketch and we'll tell you what it costs to build.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

